{"id":"630f1fe5-b637-4795-a77a-cd761546ea92","body":"Decision (Sid, 2026-10-23): this ticket becomes a sub-issue of ENG-2091. It lands after ENG-2091 adds the discovery function that returns `CrossAppNode`, and before ENG-2091 removes `SharedNode`, so the wrapper is deleted once instead of rewritten and then deleted. This refines the 2026-10-22 decision: the ticket still waits for ENG-2091's type.

Open, needs Marc-Antoine: whether `CrossAppNode` carries the author's database account id, which the import dialog uses for author names. It is one of the three fields in ENG-2091's open question.

